Authentication icon provenance
==============================

These official logos identify the corresponding authentication providers.
Artwork was downloaded directly from provider websites or repositories on
2026-10-02. Copyright and trademark rights remain with the respective owners;
the Python package's BSD license does not relicense these assets. Each provider's
artwork and branding terms apply independently. No authorship or ownership of
these logos is claimed by social-auth or Weblate contributors.

Unless explicitly described below, files are unmodified provider artwork,
including original colors, proportions, and padding. Line endings and trailing whitespace
are normalized where needed. Applications are responsible
for following the providers' sign-in and brand-use guidance when displaying them.

